Third-party material
--------------------
examples/aptp-cvpr2026/paper/ contains the LaTeX sources (main.tex, preamble.tex, sec/*.tex, main.bib) of

  Yanglin Deng, Tianyang Xu, Chunyang Cheng, Hui Li, Xiao-jun Wu, Josef Kittler.
  "Beyond Strict Pairing: Arbitrarily Paired Training for High-Performance Infrared and Visible Image Fusion."
  CVPR 2026. arXiv:2603.21820 (https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.21820).

The paper is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), as stated on its arXiv page. The sources are included unchanged;
figures and the CVPR style files (cvpr.sty, ieeenat_fullname.bst) are omitted. The authors of the paper do not endorse
this repository. The sentences of the paper also appear in examples/aptp-cvpr2026/expected/ (the reference output).

examples/aptp-cvpr2026/paper/paper.pdf is the arXiv PDF of the same paper (arXiv:2603.21820v1). The only change is that the embedded
raster images were downsampled to about 110 dpi to reduce the file size (PyMuPDF rewrite_images); text and layout are unchanged.

examples/aptp-cvpr2026/workbench.json contains Chinese renderings of the paper's sentences and short annotations (claims, links,
storyline, number records). They are adaptations (translations and summaries) written for this repository by an assistant, under the
same CC BY 4.0 license and with the same attribution. They were not written or reviewed by the authors of the paper and may contain
errors. The sentences and renderings also appear in examples/aptp-cvpr2026/expected/workbench.html.
